// notepad.marco — the type-and-Enter demo, ported from MacroMarco's Notepad
// module. Focus a Notepad window first, then:
//
//   marco run --host windows programs/notepad.marco
//
// Under --host dryrun it prints the steps without typing.

use os.

the Notepad is an actor.

this can Demo.
this's Demo does...
    do OS's Type with "Marco says hello!".
    do OS's Key with "enter".
    do OS's Sleep with 200.
    do OS's Type with "This line was automated by a Marco program.".
    do OS's Key with "enter".
    this is ok!

the App is a script.

do Notepad's Demo...
    when ok?
        log "notepad demo complete".
    or?
        log that's error.
